            "review_text": "bigskybob\nUnited States135 contributions\n0\nPizza by slice and beer\nAug 2023 • Solo\nI enjoy pizza and beer, but most places in HCMC do not offer pizza by the slice... the Paper Plate Pizza does! and it also offers a number of different beers: Tiger, IPA, etc. Monday and Wednesday slices are VND45,000/slice and they had 4 different kinds the night I was there. I recommend giving this place a try... I lnow I will be coming back :)\nWritten August 2, 2023",
