            "review_title": "Review at Paper Plate Pizza",
            "review_text": "Elaine\n49 contributions\n0\nBEST pizza anywhere!!!!\nApr 2023 • Couples\nThe absolute BEST pizza anywhere!!!! We have never had better pizza at home or anywhere else that was this good. It was outstanding. If you purchase a whole pizza you can select up to 4 different types! The food was incredible and the service was amazing!!! If you want fantastic food in Ho Chi Minh city make your way to this restaurant. It is down a small road/alley off a main road. This was our favourite restaurant. The staff are non-stop cleaning and prepping the restaurant and food. Great atmosphere!\nRead more\nService\nFood\nWritten May 10, 2023",
