            "review_title": "Review at Paper Plate Pizza",
            "review_text": "Leean W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam206 contributions\n0\nMixed Feelings But Lots of Potential\nFeb 2020\nI have read many rave reviews on Facebook about the pizzas from Paper Plate Pizza so I was eager to try their pizzas. When it first arrived I was disappointed as I only like thin crust pizzas. However the base was truly delicious and with just the right amount of crispness and was the first time ever that I have enjoyed a deep base pizza. The halved cherry tomatoes on top of the Margarita Pizza were well cooked, very tasty and a welcome addition. Where the pizza fell down for me was in the tomato base sauce which had that overcooked taste and spoiled the otherwise delicious experience. Maybe I was just unlucky so I will try their pizzas again but if the taste of the sauce could be adjusted then this could become a firm favourite.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 5, 2020",
